{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きみり愛ちゃん\nお誕生日おめぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛との2sの写メがあるのに\n衣装が解禁前のやつだからもどかしい(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また載せますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/02/9056698/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夕方からお仕事だったんだけど\nお仕事の前に\n今日発売のクリスマスツムツムのぬいぐるみを買ってから行ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/02/9056698/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、かりんちゃんに見せました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Dヲタのかりんちゃんなら\nいいリアクションをしてくれるって思って\nいつも買ったときは見せてるんだ` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィン終わったと思ったら\nもうクリスマスなんだねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/02/9056698/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は\nどんなクリスマスにします？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木中で\n『大人への近道』のスタジオライブが流れます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌収録させてもらえるなんて\n本当にありがたい＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大人への近道』の衣装好きなのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/02/9056698/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/02